      "magicresist": "25 – 86 (based on level)",
      "attackspeed": "1.75",
      "movespeed": "0",
      "control": "Heimerdinger's basic attacks and abilities apply a refreshing, high-priority mark for 3 seconds that the H-28G Evolution Turret will attack. Enemy champions who attack Heimerdinger will be targeted secondarily, and the H-28G Evolution Turret will otherwise attack the closest target to itself. H-28G Evolution Turrets are static.",
      "targeting": "Minion, does not count towards the minion kill tracking score",
      "spelleffects": "Basic attacks and beam deal pet damage, additionally tagged as proc damage, with the beam damage also being tagged as area damage, both applying spell effects.",
      "onhit": "Attacks can be mitigated by block, dodge, and blind, as well as stopped by Disarm.",
      "ccresist": "Slow",
      "abilities": ";Beam Attack\nThe H-28G Evolution Turret spawns with 0% charge, displayed below its health bar and generates 1.1% charge per second. At 100% charge, if there are targets within 900 units range, H-28G Evolution Turret fires a beam in their direction after a short wind-up, prioritizing enemy champions, and dealing 40 / 60 / 80 / 100 / 120 (+ 55% AP) magic damage to all enemies it passes through.\n\n;Deactivation\nThe H-28G Evolution Turret initiates an 8-second timer while Heimerdinger is out of range. If the timer completes, it deactivates, loses all current charge, and has its sight range reduced from 650 to 227.5 units. H-28G Evolution Turret instantly reactivates once Heimerdinger moves back into range.\n\n;Drain Immunity\nDamage dealt to the H-28G Evolution Turret does not benefit from life steal nor spell vamp.\n\n;Dynamic Stats\nThe H-28G Evolution Turret updates its stats every second to reflect changes in gameplay."
    }
  },
