      "abilities": ";Apex Shots\nH-28Q Apex Turret's basic attacks deal damage to nearby enemies around its target and slows affected targets by 25% for 1 second.\n\n;Apex Beam\nH-28Q Apex Turret spawns with 0% charge, displayed below its health bar, generates 12.5% charge per second, and an additional 20% per basic attack. At 100% charge, if there are targets in range, H-28Q Apex Turret fires a beam in their direction after a short wind-up, prioritizing enemy champions, and dealing 100 / 140 / 180 (+ 70% AP) magic damage to all enemies it passes through.\n\n;Drain Immunity\nDamage dealt to the H-28Q Apex Turret does not benefit from life steal nor spell vamp.\n\n;Dynamic Stats\nThe H-28Q Apex Turret updates its stats every second to reflect changes in gameplay."
